WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:08.103
Unique Clues is a cooperative word game with a clever twist. Three to eight players, and you're all on the same team.

2
00:00:08.803 --> 00:00:16.533
One of you is the guesser and looks away. Everyone else sees a secret word and writes down a single one-word clue for it.

3
00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:23.420
Here's the catch. Any clues that match get thrown out, and so do clues that contain the word itself.

4
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:29.082
So the obvious clue is usually the worst clue, because somebody else will have thought of it too.

5
00:00:29.782 --> 00:00:34.506
The guesser sees whatever clues survive, and either takes a guess or passes.

6
00:00:34.656 --> 00:00:39.303
Get it right and the team scores a point. Get it wrong and the card is lost.

7
00:00:40.003 --> 00:00:46.889
One more rule. No talking during the clue phase. Great minds think alike, and that's exactly the problem.
